    "flavor_text_entries": [
      {
        "flavor_text": "いやしと　めぐみの　ちからを　もつ じあいに　みちた　ポケモン。　はるか むかし　ガラルに　くんりんしていた。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja-Hrkt",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/1/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Doté de pouvoirs de guérison et d’abondance, ce Pokémon miséricordieux régnait sur Galar il y a fort longtemps.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Calyrex is a merciful Pokémon, capable of providing healing and blessings. It reigned over the Galar region in times of yore.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "癒しと　恵みの　力を　もつ 慈愛に　満ちた　ポケモン。　はるか むかし　ガラルに　君臨していた。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "おおむかしの　ガラルを　すべていた でんせつの　おう。　こころを　いやし くさきを　めぶかせる　ちからがある。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja-Hrkt",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/1/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "shield",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/34/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Ce roi légendaire qui a régné sur Galar il y a fort longtemps possède le pouvoir d’apaiser les cœurs et de faire germer les plantes.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "shield",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/34/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Calyrex is known in legend as a king that ruled over Galar in ancient times. It has the power to cause hearts to mend and plants to spring forth.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "shield",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/34/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "大昔の　ガラルを　統べていた 伝説の　王。　心を　癒し 草木を　芽吹かせる　力がある。",
